# Copy to .env.local. Only EXPO_PUBLIC_* values reach the app, and both are public: row-level
# security in supabase/migrations protects the data. NEVER put the SERVICE_ROLE_KEY here.
#
# Local development targets dev-spamset on the VPS (docs/supabase-vps.md). The URL must match
# SUPABASE_URL['dev-spamset'] in app.config.ts or the config refuses to load.
# Leave both empty for offline-only.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://dev-api.spamset.example
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
